  "answer": "m2h_b5_grammar.check runs before scoring; a reject raises CandidateLocalInvalid, so the formula keeps REWARD_FLOOR and valid_mask False. select full: adv = zfam(rewards, valid, counts) = within-family z over the VALID formulas only (mean/sd exclude rejects; one valid formula -> z 0), clipped +-3; then adv[rejected] = -1.0. dense_update runs on all 128 rows: pg_loss = mean over 128 of adv*neglogp, so rejects ARE in the loss denominator and each pushes its own tokens down with weight 1; the entropy term also averages over all 128. The whole step is skipped if batch n_valid < 20",
